    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zhen: Shattered Legacy</strong> is a <strong>Twin-Stick Brawler, Action-Adventure\u00a0</strong>where you play as a Robot Warrior Monk sent to investigate a decrepit realm in order to restore the righteous way of Kung Fu. Unleash the fury of the staff attacks by flicking your <strong>right analog stick</strong> towards the enemy\u2019s direction. Use your <strong>left analog stick</strong> to dodge and weave through hordes of enemies who are constantly trying to box you in. Take down the Boss of each martial art school to unlock their weapons and combat style, all while jamming to 90s rap inspired soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I<strong>mmersive Combat</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/ef5b8ef97e2c26bbfd0f098d1bc533f6.poster.avif?t=1749312735\" width=356 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/ef5b8ef97e2c26bbfd0f098d1bc533f6.webm?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/ef5b8ef97e2c26bbfd0f098d1bc533f6.mp4?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat and movement using Controller Analogue sticks.\u00a0Unleash the fury of the staff attacks by flicking your <strong>right analog stick</strong> towards the enemy\u2019s direction. Use your <strong>left analog stick</strong> to dodge and weave through hordes of enemies who are constantly trying to box you in. Incorporate different input combinations and timing for various combo strings.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/796191f8ed3180d3a29d867d71d17a4d.poster.avif?t=1749312735\" width=356 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/796191f8ed3180d3a29d867d71d17a4d.webm?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/796191f8ed3180d3a29d867d71d17a4d.mp4?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Zhen, set in a post-apocalyptic time in a fictional East-Asian land. Humanity is nowhere to be seen and replaced by sentient robots. A world where stories of war, peace and hope, can be felt and seen either through environment or interactions with the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Battle Encounters and Boss Fights</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/f59b1a20796694633a126769f7b42a65.poster.avif?t=1749312735\" width=356 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/f59b1a20796694633a126769f7b42a65.webm?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/f59b1a20796694633a126769f7b42a65.mp4?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with vicious and savage enemies that will try to overrun you and constantly trying to box you in. And duel with highly trained masters or their respective weapons where your skill as a Kung Fu Warrior Monk will be tested.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Weapons and Skills</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various weapons and skills available to unlock as you progress your adventure. Different weapons with different attack patterns and properties helps diversify your approach to combat. You can even use these weapons to unlock paths that was once obstructed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zhen: Shattered Legacy</strong> is a <strong>Twin-Stick Brawler, Action-Adventure\u00a0</strong>where you play as a Robot Warrior Monk sent to investigate a decrepit realm in order to restore the righteous way of Kung Fu. Unleash the fury of the staff attacks by flicking your <strong>right analog stick</strong> towards the enemy\u2019s direction. Use your <strong>left analog stick</strong> to dodge and weave through hordes of enemies who are constantly trying to box you in. Take down the Boss of each martial art school to unlock their weapons and combat style, all while jamming to 90s rap inspired soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I<strong>mmersive Combat</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/ef5b8ef97e2c26bbfd0f098d1bc533f6.poster.avif?t=1749312735\" width=356 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/ef5b8ef97e2c26bbfd0f098d1bc533f6.webm?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/ef5b8ef97e2c26bbfd0f098d1bc533f6.mp4?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat and movement using Controller Analogue sticks.\u00a0Unleash the fury of the staff attacks by flicking your <strong>right analog stick</strong> towards the enemy\u2019s direction. Use your <strong>left analog stick</strong> to dodge and weave through hordes of enemies who are constantly trying to box you in. Incorporate different input combinations and timing for various combo strings.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/796191f8ed3180d3a29d867d71d17a4d.poster.avif?t=1749312735\" width=356 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/796191f8ed3180d3a29d867d71d17a4d.webm?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/796191f8ed3180d3a29d867d71d17a4d.mp4?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Zhen, set in a post-apocalyptic time in a fictional East-Asian land. Humanity is nowhere to be seen and replaced by sentient robots. A world where stories of war, peace and hope, can be felt and seen either through environment or interactions with the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Battle Encounters and Boss Fights</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/f59b1a20796694633a126769f7b42a65.poster.avif?t=1749312735\" width=356 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/f59b1a20796694633a126769f7b42a65.webm?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755890/extras/f59b1a20796694633a126769f7b42a65.mp4?t=1749312735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with vicious and savage enemies that will try to overrun you and constantly trying to box you in. And duel with highly trained masters or their respective weapons where your skill as a Kung Fu Warrior Monk will be tested.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Weapons and Skills</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various weapons and skills available to unlock as you progress your adventure. Different weapons with different attack patterns and properties helps diversify your approach to combat. You can even use these weapons to unlock paths that was once obstructed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
